@startuml
title Feature: UML Diagram Generation - Sequence Diagram
autonumber
participant DiagramStrategy
participant SequenceDiagramStrategy
participant ClassDiagramStrategy
SequenceDiagramStrategy -> ClassDiagramStrategy: generate()
activate ClassDiagramStrategy
ClassDiagramStrategy --> SequenceDiagramStrategy: return
deactivate ClassDiagramStrategy
ClassDiagramStrategy -> DiagramStrategy: generate()
activate DiagramStrategy
DiagramStrategy --> ClassDiagramStrategy: return
deactivate DiagramStrategy
@enduml